      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "圆圆：方方，最近怎么样？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：方方，最近怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán fāng fāng zuì jìn zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Fangfang, how are things lately?"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "方方：别提了，我谈了一个男朋友。",
      "traditional": "方方：別提了，我談了一個男朋友。",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng bié tí le wǒ tán le yí ge nán péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Don’t ask, I got a boyfriend."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "圆圆：是吗？这不是挺好的吗？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：是嗎？這不是挺好的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán shì ma zhè bú shì tǐng hǎo de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Really? Isn’t that a good thing?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "方方：好什么呀，你可不知道他有多幼稚，",
      "traditional": "方方：好什麼呀，你可不知道他有多幼稚，",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng hǎo shén me ya nǐ kě bù zhī dào tā yǒu duō yòu zhì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "张口闭口都是我妈妈说，我妈妈说的。",
      "traditional": "張口閉口都是我媽媽說，我媽媽說的。",
      "pinyin": "zhāng kǒu bì kǒu dōu shì wǒ mā ma shuō wǒ mā ma shuō de",
      "english": "Fangfang: Not really. You don’t know how childish he is."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "All he ever talks about is “my mother says this”, “my mother says that”…"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "圆圆：难道，他是个妈宝男？",
      "traditional": "圓圓：難道，他是個媽寶男？",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán nán dào tā shì ge mā bǎo nán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: Don’t tell me he’s a mama’s boy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "方方：妈宝男是什么？",
      "traditional": "方方：媽寶男是什麼？",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng mā bǎo nán shì shén me",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: What’s mama’s boy?"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "圆圆：妈宝男，就是那些什么都听妈妈的，",
      "traditional": "圓圓：媽寶男，就是那些什麼都聽媽媽的，",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán mā bǎo nán jiù shì nà xiē shén me dōu tīng mā ma de",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "什么都以妈妈为中心，被妈妈宠坏了的大宝宝。",
      "traditional": "什麼都以媽媽為中心，被媽媽寵壞了的大寶寶。",
      "pinyin": "shén me dōu yǐ mā ma wéi zhōng xīn bèi mā ma chǒng huài le de dà bǎo bao",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: A mama’s boy is someone who listens to whatever his mother says."
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Everything centers around his mother, and he's a big baby spoiled by his mother."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "方方：对，我觉得他就是妈宝男！",
      "traditional": "方方：對，我覺得他就是媽寶男！",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng duì wǒ jué de tā jiù shì mā bǎo nán",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Yes, I think he's a mama’s boy!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "圆圆：不过，听说妈宝男很孝顺啊。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：不過，聽說媽寶男很孝順啊。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán bú guò tīng shuō mā bǎo nán hěn xiào shùn a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: However, I heard that mama’s boys are very filial."
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "方方：是啊，我是妈妈的话，当然很喜欢这样的儿子。可是，我是他的女朋友啊！",
      "traditional": "方方：是啊，我是媽媽的話，當然很喜歡這樣的兒子。可是，我是他的女朋友啊！",
      "pinyin": "fāng fāng shì a wǒ shì mā ma de huà dāng rán hěn xǐ huan zhè yàng de ér zi kě shì wǒ shì tā de nǚ péng you a",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Fangfang: Yes, if I were a mother, of course I would love to have a son like this. However, I’m his girlfriend!"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "圆圆：别身在福中不知福了。我连个男朋友都还没有呢。",
      "traditional": "圓圓：別身在福中不知福了。我連個男朋友都還沒有呢。",
      "pinyin": "yuán yuán bié shēn zài fú zhōng bù zhī fú le wǒ lián ge nán péng you dōu hái méi yǒu ne",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Yuanyuan: You don't know how lucky you are. I haven't even got a boyfriend yet."
    }
  ],
