    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mama’s boy",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: Fangfang, how are things lately?",
      "",
      "Fangfang: Don’t ask, I got a boyfriend.",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: Really? Isn’t that a good thing?",
      "",
      "Fangfang: Not really. You don’t know how childish he is.",
      "All he ever talks about is “my mother says this”, “my mother says that”…",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: Don’t tell me he’s a mama’s boy?",
      "",
      "Fangfang: What’s mama’s boy?",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: A mama’s boy is someone who listens to whatever his mother says.",
      "Everything centers around his mother, and he's a big baby spoiled by his mother.",
      "",
      "Fangfang: Yes, I think he's a mama’s boy!",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: However, I heard that mama’s boys are very filial.",
      "",
      "Fangfang: Yes, if I were a mother, of course I would love to have a son like this. However, I’m his girlfriend!",
      "",
      "Yuanyuan: You don't know how lucky you are. I haven't even got a boyfriend yet.",
      ""
    ]
  }
